# The wasm translation unit is compiled by wasm/build_wasm.sh with include/,
# src/utils and wasm on the path (and the amalgamated bovnar.h ahead of them in
# the real build). Without them the editor's clang cannot find bovnar.h at all,
# so every symbol in the file reads as undeclared. One flag per entry: a
# "-I include" with a space is a single argument whose path starts with a space.
CompileFlags:
  Add:
    - -Iinclude
    - -Isrc/utils
    - -Iwasm
    - -std=c11
